WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.939
The One Piece Manga just revealed the real
name of one of the Gorosei and I accidentally

00:00:03.939 --> 00:00:08.660
used it to crack he hidden logic behind the
whole One Piece series.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:13.589
Not only do we now know that the Gorosei are
5 of the 7 most powerful people in One Piece

00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:17.910
and how they keep the world in balance, but
also what might have really happened between

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:23.090
the Gorosei, Imu and Joy Boy and how Luffy
and Blackbeard tie into all of it.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:28.630
Now the Gorosei that gets revealed in chapter
1073 is this guy here with the white locks

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.930
and the massive scar across the left side
of his face.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:35.059
His name is Saint Jay Garcia Saturn.

00:00:35.059 --> 00:00:40.829
A name that truly no one expected, because
you wont believe how much information we can

00:00:40.829 --> 00:00:42.750
pull from just this name.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.520
I promise, you’re gonna love this.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:50.250
The first thing we can deduce, based on the
saint title, is that the Gorosei truly are

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.840
celestial dragons themselves.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.359
This was only revealed very recently.

00:00:54.359 --> 00:00:58.360
For the longest time it was believed that
the Gorosei were actually lower in authority

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:03.120
than the average celestial dragons, who were
simply in charge of running the world while

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.780
the nobles could enjoy their luxurious life.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:10.860
However during the Reverie arc, it was revealed
that the Gorosei are nobles themselves, with

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:16.509
much more power than someone like this guy,
who Luffy punched in the slave auction house.

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:22.670
This Gorosei, Saturn, seems to be from a family
called Jay Garcia, which surprisingly is only

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:27.540
the second world noble family name we have
heard in the story next to the don quixote

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:28.540
family.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:33.740
And so we can see, that the celestial dragons
seem to have a somewhat Spanish theme to their

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:34.740
names.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.720
The Don Quixote Family and the Jay Garcia
family.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:41.020
Now Don Quixote is of course based on the
famous book character chasing wind mills,

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.360
but Jay Garcia doesn’t immediately ring
a bell.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.420
That is, unless you are into Rock music.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:52.950
Because Jay Garcia was the guitarist and singer
of the rock band ‘Grateful Dead’.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:58.020
And to be honest, there is quite a lot of
similarity between him and Saturn.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:01.470
But he’s not the only inspiration for this
Gorosei.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:06.960
Now, in case you don’t know, all 5 of the
Gorosei are probably inspired by famous politicians

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:07.960
of the past.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:12.690
The bold one with glasses is most likely based
on the indian revolutionary Mahatma Gandhi.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.470
THe guy with the birthmark and the giant mustache
is based on the last sovjet president Mikhail

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.470
Gorbachev.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:23.190
The guy with the ridiculously long beard looks
very similar to the japanese politician Itagaki

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:24.190
Taisuke.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:29.879
The blond guy, who looks like Sanji’s long
lost uncle, is based on a young Abraham Lincoln.

00:02:29.879 --> 00:02:33.560
And finally, saint Jay Garcia Saturn looks
like Karl Marx.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.640
Don’t worry this will all make sense in
a moment.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:41.511
Now all of these figures represent very different
political ideologies and all of them had their

00:02:41.511 --> 00:02:46.599
flaws, but what unites all of them at least
from a historical perspective, is that they

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:50.410
are all associated with giving people more
freedom.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:55.450
Lincoln is known for ending slavery in the
US, Gandhi ended British Colonial Rule in

00:02:55.450 --> 00:03:00.269
India, Marx' fundamental idea, that was later
strongly misused by multiple regimes, was

00:03:00.269 --> 00:03:05.500
the theory of liberty, stating that the freedom
of the people is the most important right,

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.019
that should not be exploited and controlled
by those with power and money.

00:03:09.019 --> 00:03:13.640
Gorbachov was the last president of the Soviet
Union, who with his ideas of glasnost and

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:18.959
perestroika (openness and restructuring) promoted
democratic thinking and liberty in Eastern

00:03:18.959 --> 00:03:22.510
Europe that ultimately led to the collapse
of the Soviet Union.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:26.970
And finally Itagaki was leader of the Freedom
and People's Rights Movement and involved

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:30.500
with the founding of the first democratic
political party in Japan.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.500
Which makes us wonder: Either Oda-sensei is
being very ironic by basing the authoritarian

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:32.500
rulers of the world on people fighting for
freedom.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.500
Or there is something more to this.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.500
As this chapter proves: There definitely is.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.500
We’ll get to the really crazy part in just
a second.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.500
There is really only a handful of things we
know ab out the Gorosei for sure.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.690
Surprisingly, even though, they are the 5
most powerful people in the story, only answering

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:45.720
to the secret ruler Imu, they were only introduced
in chapter 233 of one piece.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:50.000
They have full control over the Marines and
all the cypher pole agencies.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.810
In fact Rob Lucci’s CP0 serves only them.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:58.200
Which makes Stussy’s role as a double agent
even more interesting.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:03.170
I wonder what information she might have overheard
from the five elders that she could share

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.349
with the straw hats.

00:04:04.349 --> 00:04:08.819
We also know that the Gorosei are fully aware
of the true history and what happened during

00:04:08.819 --> 00:04:09.819
the void century.

00:04:09.819 --> 00:04:13.879
And there is even the very popular theory,
that all 5 of them are actually from the void

00:04:13.879 --> 00:04:15.170
century themselves.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:19.910
Former Kings of the 20 kingdoms that created
the world government who have been granted

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:20.910
immortality.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:25.729
The Gorosei have also conducted a number of
great cleansings over time, whenever a new

00:04:25.729 --> 00:04:28.000
threat to the world government’s rule has
popped up.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.390
But one thing we could only speculate about
so far was their actual physical power.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:38.140
As celestial dragons, it would seem likely,
that the Gorosei have enjoyed a life of luxury

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:41.419
without pain and suffering, like all the other
world nobles.

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:45.780
However, not only do they not wear the same
goofy looking space suits as the other nobles,

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:48.550
but they also seem to have battle experience.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:53.850
The bald Gorosei is wielding a sword, that
many believe to be the Shodai Kitetsu, the

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:59.630
supreme grade version of Zoro’s sandai Kitetsu
sword or the nidai kitetsu that we saw in

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:00.630
Wano.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:04.720
The guy who looks like Saji’s uncle looks
extremely fit as well and Saint Jay Garcia

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:09.139
Saturn has a large scar across his face.

00:05:09.139 --> 00:05:14.259
So could the Gorosei be hiding some truly
powerful abilities?

00:05:14.259 --> 00:05:18.350
I think with the reveal of Saturn’s name,
there is a really high probability that the

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:24.410
Gorosei can not only fight, but that they
are 5 of the 7 most powerful forces in One

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:25.410
Piece.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:29.590
Manu, how in the world can you say that so
confidently when we only have one name?

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.280
Well I was getting to that jeez.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:37.920
So, the first thing you probably noticed about
the name saturn is that it is a planet.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:38.920
Duh.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:43.060
This of course is interesting, because the
planets are named after roman gods, who again

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:44.319
are based on greek gods.

00:05:44.319 --> 00:05:49.509
And as you already know, the 3 ancient weapons
are all named after a greek god and thus after

00:05:49.509 --> 00:05:56.259
a planet: Pluton is Pluto, Uranus is the planet
Uranus and Poseidon is the Greek version of

00:05:56.259 --> 00:05:57.259
Neptune.

00:05:57.259 --> 00:06:00.610
Those are the last 3 planets in our solar
system.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:03.750
Well at least they were when Oda started writing
one piece.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.820
Pluto has not quite survived since then as
a planet.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:10.780
Now if you know your planets using whatever
memorization phrase YOU learned in school,

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:14.979
you will know that saturn is the next planet
in line.

00:06:14.979 --> 00:06:16.639
Now, coincindence you could say.

00:06:16.639 --> 00:06:20.009
But first of all, those don’t exist, especially
not in One Piece.

00:06:20.009 --> 00:06:22.479
But check out this: There are 9 planets.

00:06:22.479 --> 00:06:28.660
3 of them are ancient weapons, one is earth
itself, which leaves us with 5 remaining planets

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.730
for 5 of the Gorosei.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:34.530
Saturn, Jupiter, Mars, Venus an Mercury.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:39.289
And suddenly the japanese word Gorosei makes
a lot more sense.

00:06:39.289 --> 00:06:43.610
It used to be translated as the five elder
stars.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:47.009
however the kanji for Star also means planet.

00:06:47.009 --> 00:06:51.850
In other words, the Gorosei are actually the
five elder planets.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:59.410
So by revealing just ONE SINGLE NAME, Oda
seems to tease all of the Gorosei’s individual

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.410
powers.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:04.470
And there are actually 2 options for what
those powers are.

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:06.919
Number one are based the roman gods.

00:07:06.919 --> 00:07:11.530
We know that Poseidon is the god of the sea,
and the ancinet weapon Poseidon, Shirahoshi

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.230
has powers that are connected to the sea.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:19.140
Pluton, which is hidden inside the vulcano
on Wano seems to have powers connected to

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:25.370
the underworld like Pluto and Uranus, is speculated
to be connected to the sky, just like the

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.370
god of heaven.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:31.039
Going with that logic, Saint Saturn could
have the powers of the god Saturn, the god

00:07:31.039 --> 00:07:32.039
of time.

00:07:32.039 --> 00:07:34.830
Jupiter, who is Zeus in Greek, is the god
of thunder.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.389
Mars is the god of war.

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:38.070
Venus is the goddess of love.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:42.820
And mercury or hermes in Greek is the messenger
god and god of trickery.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:47.430
All of these would could be plausable powers
for the Gorosei.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.430
HOWEVER.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:53.139
I would argue that these gods aren’t actually
related to their powers at all.

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:56.539
The god of thunder to me sounds more like
Enel.

00:07:56.539 --> 00:07:59.569
The god of war doesn’t really make sense.

00:07:59.569 --> 00:08:02.490
Love to me is Boa Hancock.

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:06.389
And being a messanger sounds like a pretty
lame power to me.

00:08:06.389 --> 00:08:11.280
Instead, I’d like to argue, that these are
not the Gorosei’s powers, but rather their

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.099
roles as heads of the government.

00:08:14.099 --> 00:08:17.810
Mercury would be in charge of communication
and messaging, be it with the Marines, Cypther

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.330
Pole or people like Shanks.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.550
Mars would be the Gorosei in charge of war.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:26.139
He would be the Gorosei who was organizing
the war at marineford for example.

00:08:26.139 --> 00:08:32.339
Jupiter I personally think would be the Gorosei
in charge of using the ancient weapon uranus.

00:08:32.339 --> 00:08:36.580
After all it looks like the world government
used it to destroy an entire island just a

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:37.830
few chapters ago.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:44.140
And Saturn, our Gorosei in this chapter, would
be in charge of anything related to time and

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.140
history.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:49.540
so it would only make sense that he is the
guy who is coming for Vegapunk, who has all

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:54.070
the lost knowledge from the ancient kingdom,
that was gathered by the researchers on Ohara.

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:58.560
As for Venus and love, I have no idea what
that would be about honestly.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:01.269
That’s a bit of a hole in that theory.

00:09:01.269 --> 00:09:06.519
Maybe Oda took her as the god of prosperity
and not love and it’s the Gorosei in charge

00:09:06.519 --> 00:09:08.750
of finances or something.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:15.280
Now, if the gods aren’t the true powers
of the Gorosei, what is?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.770
Let me flex my japanese skills a little bit
for this.

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.970
There are specific kanji for each of the planets.

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:27.510
Pluto has the kanji for darkness, the same
as Rayleigh’s dark king title by the way.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:31.780
Uranus has the kanji for sky and neptune has
the kanji for the ocean.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:34.190
The are kind of in their own category.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:39.270
The 5 planets connected to the 5 elders share
a different category of symbols.

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:46.000
They are the 5 traditional elements: Fire,
Wood, Water, Earth and Metal.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:50.899
Mars has the kanji for fire, kasei. Mercury
has the kanji for water, suisei.

00:09:50.899 --> 00:09:53.080
Jupiter is wood, mokusei.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.040
Venus is metal, Kinsei.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.640
And Saturn is Earth.

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:57.640
Dosei.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:01.720
I think that these 5 elements make way more
sense for the Gorosei’s ture powers than

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:02.760
the greek gods.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:08.100
Fire, Wood, Water, Earth and Metal could be
versions of devil fruits or some other sort

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:11.750
of special ability, comparable to the ancient
weapons.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.670
But if you think we’re done.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.660
We’re just getting started.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:18.540
The best part is what comes next.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.709
Because the 5 traditional chinese elements
aren’t alone.

00:10:21.709 --> 00:10:28.580
this entire ancient system is known as the
doctrine of Yin-Yang and the Five Elements.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:33.089
In other words the 5 elements surround the
yin and yang, the dark and the light that

00:10:33.089 --> 00:10:35.209
bring balance to the universe.

00:10:35.209 --> 00:10:41.600
So next to the 5 Gorosei, we have a force
of light and a force of dark that keeps the

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.060
balance in the universe.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:47.510
I wonder, have we ever heard anything related
to light or dark in one piece?

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.510
hmm.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:51.750
In the unlikely case you still haven’t caught
on yet, let me show you this.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:55.230
This is one normal week in a japanese calendar.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:11:00.940
You’ll notice that 5 of the 7 days of the
week have the same Kanji as the 5 planets

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:04.810
slash the 5 elements: Tuesday is fire, mars.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.630
Wednesday is water, mercury.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.709
Thursday is wood, jupiter.

00:11:08.709 --> 00:11:12.540
Friday is Metal, Venus and Saturday is Earth,
Saturn.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:16.200
The two remaining days are, you guessed it,
sunday and monday.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.440
The day of the sun and the day of the moon.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.970
Same in japanese.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:26.089
Sunday has the kanji for the sun and monday
has the kanji for the moon.

00:11:26.089 --> 00:11:27.510
Yin and Yang.

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.510
Darkness and light.

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:29.840
The five elements.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.610
Also I’m really grateful to Oda.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:36.220
Thanks to One Piece I know finally understand
the logic behind both the weekdays AND the

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:38.030
planets in Japanese.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:42.270
So, the sun part of this diagram is pretty
easy to fill I think.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:44.470
That’s of course the Sun God.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.470
Nika.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:50.320
This is how the Gorosei are directly connected
to both Joy boy and Luffy.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:53.110
The Moon part on the other hand could be 2
people i think.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.209
Either it’s blackbeard, the kid who never
sleeps.

00:11:56.209 --> 00:12:00.550
The dark opposite to Luffy and the kid that
was crying under the moon.

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:03.590
Or it is Imu, the secret ruler of the world.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.950
The person who defeated Joy Boy and the ancient
kingdom.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:10.390
The darkness that balances Luffy’s light.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:14.760
This makes sense on so many levels.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:17.190
Why Luffy’s devil fruit is so important.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.700
What it means for Luffy to have become Joy
Boy.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:24.310
Why Shanks, who cares about the balance of
the world was meeting with the Gorosei.

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:27.730
Why Blackbeard is the polar opposite to Luffy.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:33.880
And this system might also tell us a little
bit about what happened during the void century.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:38.640
For instance, it could mean that the Gorosei
once all ruled over different planets.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:44.160
Or it could mean that the Gorosei, Imu and
Joy boy were once allies, that created a balance

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:50.000
across the world until Imu decided to betray
Joy Boy to break that balance.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.339
Or it could mean that it will take both Luffy
and Blackbeard, the reincarnations of Joy

00:12:55.339 --> 00:13:01.279
Boy and Rocks D Xebec together in order to
bring balance back to the world and take down

00:13:01.279 --> 00:13:05.230
Imu who broke that balance.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:09.160
That might also explain why the Gorosei are
modeld after politicians who are known for

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.959
bringing people freedom.

00:13:10.959 --> 00:13:15.560
Maybe they are actually a force for the good,
the 5 gods waiting for the sun and the moon

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:20.839
gods to return to bring back balance to the
universe.

00:13:20.839 --> 00:13:25.060
Which would also explain why Shanks would
work with them.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:30.980
I was puzzling most of this together while
writing this script, so if you want a follow

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:36.540
up video on this where i have more time to
think about it, let me know by subscribing

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:37.540
to the channel.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.649
And here is last week’s review!

00:13:39.649 --> 00:13:41.570
Make sure to check that out too!

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:42.890
THanks for watching.

